WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.000
How much can a coin tell you? A fair coin has one bit of
uncertainty. Follow that question into Bucket.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:17.751
Start with a question. Explore searches research sources
from the desktop.

00:00:17.751 --> 00:00:28.297
Keep a useful result. Your saved papers remain here when
you return.

00:00:28.297 --> 00:00:36.631
Search the bundled Canon for entropy. Open a result to
follow the idea to its source.

00:00:36.631 --> 00:00:44.320
Learn, Path, Quiz, and Review connect study with practice.
Start with a bundled course or add your own material.

00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:51.930
Write down the question and keep the source beside it.
Notes are saved on this computer.

00:00:51.930 --> 00:00:58.999
Analyze data accepts tables from your own files. Data and
History keep the work within reach.

00:00:58.999 --> 00:01:05.042
Bring your own material into the workspace. Try the coin
example on the download page, then take Bucket with you.
